- If the RemindType trigger condition is UNFINISHED, the value is returned in the {"hour":23,"minu":59} format. The value of hour ranges from 0 to 47, and the value of minu ranges from 0 to 59.

- If the RemindType trigger condition is ERROR, an empty value is returned.

- If the RemindType trigger condition is CYCLE_UNFINISHED, the value is returned in the {"1":"05:50","2":"06:50","3":"07:50","4":"08:50","5":"09:50","6":"10:50","7":"11:50","8":"12:50","9":"13:50","10":"14:50","11":"15:50","12":"16:50","13":"17:50","14":"18:50","15":"19:50","16":"20:50","17":"21:50","18":"22:50","19":"23:50","20":"24:50","21":"25:50"} format. The key in the JSON string is the cycle number, which ranges from 1 to 288. The value is the time by which the cycle must be completed for the cycle, in the hh:mm format. The value of hh ranges from 0 to 47, and the value of mm ranges from 0 to 59.

- If the RemindType trigger condition is TIMEOUT, the value is returned in seconds, such as 1800. This indicates that an alert is triggered if the node runs for more than 30 minutes.', example='{"hour":23,"minu":59}'),
    dndEnd?: string(name='DndEnd', description='The end time of the do-not-disturb period, in the hh:mm format. The value of hh ranges from 0 to 23, and the value of mm ranges from 0 to 59.', example='08:00'),
    dndStart?: string(name='DndStart', description='The start time of the do-not-disturb period, in the hh:mm format. The value of hh ranges from 0 to 23, and the value of mm ranges from 0 to 59.', example='00:00'),
    founder?: string(name='Founder', description='The Alibaba Cloud UID of the user who created the custom monitoring rule.', example='9527951795****'),
    maxAlertTimes?: int32(name='MaxAlertTimes', description='The maximum number of alerts.', example='3'),
    nodes?: [ 
      {
        nodeId?: long(name='NodeId', description='The ID of the node.', example='1234'),
        nodeName?: string(name='NodeName', description='The name of the node.', example='Node name'),
        owner?: string(name='Owner', description='The Alibaba Cloud UID of the node owner.', example='9527951795****'),
        projectId?: long(name='ProjectId', description='The ID of the workspace to which the node belongs.', example='1234'),
      }
    ](name='Nodes', description='The list of nodes for monitoring by the rule when the RemindUnit object type is NODE.'),
    projects?: [ 
      {
        projectId?: long(name='ProjectId', description='The ID of the workspace.', example='1234'),
      }
    ](name='Projects', description='The list of workspaces for monitoring by the rule when the RemindUnit object type is PROJECT.'),
    receivers?: [ 
      {
        alertTargets?: [ string ](name='AlertTargets', description='The alert recipient.'),
        alertUnit?: string(name='AlertUnit', description='The alert recipient type. For multiple types of alert recipients, refer to the Receivers response parameter. Valid values:
- OWNER: task owner.
- OTHER: specified user.
- SHIFT_SCHEDULE: duty roster.', example='OWNER'),
      }
    ](name='Receivers', description='The alert recipient information.'),
    remindId?: long(name='RemindId', description='The ID of the custom monitoring rule.', example='1234'),
    remindName?: string(name='RemindName', description='The name of the rule.', example='Rule name'),
    remindType?: string(name='RemindType', description='The trigger condition. Valid values: FINISHED (completed), UNFINISHED (not completed), ERROR (error occurred), CYCLE_UNFINISHED (epoch uncompleted), and TIMEOUT (timeout).', example='FINISHED'),
    remindUnit?: string(name='RemindUnit', description='The type of the monitored object. Valid values: NODE (node), BASELINE (baseline), PROJECT (workspace), and BIZPROCESS (business flow).', example='NODE'),
    robots?: [ 
      {
        atAll?: boolean(name='AtAll', description='Specifies whether to mention all members. Valid values:
- true: yes.
- false: no.', example='true'),
        webUrl?: string(name='WebUrl', description='The webhook URL of the DingTalk chatbot.', example='https://oapi.dingtalk.com/robot/send?access_token=******************************'),
      }
    ](name='Robots', description='The webhook URLs of the DingTalk chatbots.'),
    useflag?: boolean(name='Useflag', description='Indicates whether the custom monitoring rule is enabled. Valid values:
- true: enabled.
- false: disabled.', example='true'),
    webhooks?: [ string ](name='Webhooks', description='WebHook URL'),
  }(name='Data', description='The details of the custom monitoring rule.'),
  errorCode?: string(name='ErrorCode', description='The error code.', example='1031203110005'),
  errorMessage?: string(name='ErrorMessage', description='The error message.', example='The specified parameters are invalid.'),
  httpStatusCode?: int32(name='HttpStatusCode', description='The HTTP status code.', example='200'),
